# pause-ride.xrs - the pause menu rides the HUD window (VR-117), judged by
# what the compositor receives: the projection layer keeps flowing through the
# pause (projectionViews stays 2, no mono quad), the HUD quad carries the menu
# (quadLayers >= 1), the flag survives 10 s (VR-71: no stale-flag clear), and
# the resume never drops the projection (both eyes fresh at the next submit).
#
# Needs GAMEPLAY and the game window reachable (game-key.ps1 foregrounds it).
# The log lines to read beside it: `ui/ride: Pause -> RIDING`,
# `stereo/state: STEREO ... standIn=riding`, and the `stereo: beat` line
# reading L/s=R/s>0 mono/s=0 through the pause.
#
#   tools\xrsim-run.ps1 -Path tools\xrsim\pause-ride.xrs -Dir D:\dvr-data\xrsim
reset
# The aim dot (VR-57) is a quad layer too: park it so quadLayers counts the HUD alone.
@mod stereo reentry; hud on; hud menu on; crosshair dot off
@frames 240
@assert sessionState eq FOCUSED
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@assert quadLayers ge 1

# Pause: the projection must STAY (a riding screen does not own presentation).
@key Escape
@frames 120
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@assert quadLayers ge 1
@shot pause_riding
# Hold it 10 s: VR-71's stale-flag test must not clear a real pause menu.
@wait 10000
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@assert quadLayers ge 1
@shot pause_held

# Resume: no drop to the screen, both eyes fresh at the next submit. (No
# projStaleSubmits assert here, unlike pause-resume.xrs: paused, the re-entry
# gates flip between single and double draws and the runtime re-submits the
# held projection on the textureless presents, which the sim counts as stale
# submits - measured 634 over a 12 s pause on 2026-09-15. The mono-screen pause
# hid the same holds behind its quad.)
@key Escape
@frames 120
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@assert eyeAgeL le 0
@assert eyeAgeR le 0
@shot resumed

# The old behaviour is one command away (the A/B): with menus off the window,
# a pause falls to the mono screen as before.
@mod hud menu off
@frames 30
@key Escape
@frames 120
@assert projectionViews eq 0
@shot pause_screen
@key Escape
@frames 120
@assert projectionViews eq 2
@mod hud menu on; crosshair dot on
